{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unrestricted Strategic Survival Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe\u2019s resources are finite, but humanity\u2019s ambition is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fall of Earth, power-hungry elites began chasing wealth and immortality, forsaking compassion for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the ruthless balance between despair and hope?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/e1c2a37982c97aa1deec2353e0cd1795.avif?t=1761200460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras_big/e1c2a37982c97aa1deec2353e0cd1795.avif?t=1761200460 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle to Survive Under Oppression, Extraction PvPvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10\u201320 players fight fiercely to claim the galaxy\u2019s most coveted resource: <strong>Luminite</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must carry what you've gathered to a designated extraction point. Outsmarting, ambushing, and overpowering other survivors along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/26c19bc71a8e96a404374cd6065dba96.avif?t=1761200460\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Melee Combat That Dictates Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Last Nova</i> is close, brutal, and precise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only cold weapons are allowed\u2014no firearms, no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge blades and blunt force tools, master your timing, and use dodges, blocks, and ripostes to control each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 